  "description": "A dependency-free YAML document API, shaped like FSharp.Data's JsonValue: a discriminated union DU you can pattern match, Parse/Load, a `?` dynamic operator and AsInteger()-style accessors.",
  "id": "Flexi.Yaml",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-26T21:16:45.35Z",
