  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Initial release: `YamlValue` DU, `Parse`/`Load`, `?` dynamic operator, `As*` accessors, round-tripping `ToString()`, anchors/aliases, multi-document streams, `YamlDocument` with comment round-tripping, and `GetPath`/`TryGetPath`/`SetPath` builders.\nFable support: compiles to JavaScript and Python from the same source, and the package ships its F# sources under `fable/`.\nSource positions (`ParseWithPositions`) and original timestamp text (`ParseWithMetadata`).\n`IsAotCompatible` library.",
